  "title": "Bolo de Fuba Cremoso (Creamy Cornmeal Cake)",
  "description": "This quick and easy blender cake from Brazil gets its bright yellow color from cornmeal and has a deliciously creamy, custard-like center.",
  "authors": [
    "limacla"
  ],
